<title>UK: Banco de Galicia sets $100 million five-year bond. [CORRECTED 11:19 GMT]</title>
<headline>Banco de Galicia sets $100 million five-year bond. [CORRECTED 11:19 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects type of instrument).</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DE GALICIA</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    26.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    26.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +165-170 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB+	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.JUL.02</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
